<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Landing Section</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Rule The Exchange</h1>

    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <img src="icon1.png" alt="">
            <h3>Knowledge Base</h3>
            <p>
                Sharpen up your trading know-how with our comprehensive
                Knowledge Base containing helpful instructions and tutorials.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="icon2.png" alt="">
            <h3>24/7 Support</h3>
            <p>
                We're here for you when you need us with 24/7 support
                via both live chat and help desk.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h2>You'll wonder how you ever<br>lived without us</h2>

    <button>Get Started for Free</button>
</section>

</body>
</html>

CSS CODE:
body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

.hero {
    background-image: url(https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/blue-gradient-abstract-background-with-glowing-waves_615931-202.jpg);
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 80px 20px;   /* space inside section */
    color: white;        /* text color */
    text-align: center;
}



.hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.cards {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.card {
    background: white;
    color: #333;
    width: 320px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-align: left;
}

.card img {
    width: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.card h3 {
    margin: 10px 0;
}

.hero h2 {
    margin-top: 50px;
}

button {
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 12px 30px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 25px;
    background: #2ecc71;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
    cursor: pointer;
}
